  "notes": "VERB FORM:\n{反論|はんろん}する - to argue against, to rebut\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {反論|はんろん}の{余地|よち}がない - no room for argument\n- {反論|はんろん}を{許|ゆる}さない - to not allow objections\n- {反論|はんろん}を{述|の}べる - to state a counterargument\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {異論|いろん} - objection, dissenting opinion\n- {異議|いぎ} - objection (formal, legal)\n- {抗議|こうぎ} - protest",
